  "goodToKnow": "Die Signatur is a signature in technical or formal contexts: die E-Mail-Signatur, die elektronische Signatur, an artist's signature on a painting. For everyday handwritten signatures, Germans say die Unterschrift. In libraries, die Signatur is the shelf mark. Signieren means to sign books or artworks: Der Autor signiert sein Buch. Stressed on the last syllable: zig-na-TOOR. Plural: die Signaturen."
